 * publicly described bug reports and recommended-practice notes.
 * No proprietary geometry or names are reproduced. The entity IDs
 * and minimal coordinates are author-original.
 *
 * Cross-refs: see STEP_PROBLEM_CATALOG.md §12.6 for full entry,
 * source list, sender attribution and expected kernel behavior.
 */
#900 = DESCRIPTIVE_REPRESENTATION_ITEM('catalog_id','P002');
#901 = DESCRIPTIVE_REPRESENTATION_ITEM('catalog_section','12.6 assembly hierarchy');
